# <%= projectName %>

Keenko application workspace. Node 24 runs Nx and tooling that requires Node; Bun <%= bunVersion %> owns packages, scripts, the lockfile, and supported application execution.

## Commands

```sh
bun install
bun x nx sync
bun run check
bun run dev
```

Add shadcn components from the app boundary: `bun run ui -- button`. The CLI routes reusable UI into `packages/ui`.
